Package: batocera-games-catalog
Version: 1.0.0
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-pip, python3-venv, nodejs (>= 18.0.0), npm (>= 9.0.0), systemd, adduser
Recommends: nginx, libnginx-mod-http-image-filter, certbot, python3-certbot-nginx
Maintainer: Batocera Games Catalog <admin@example.com>
Description: Batocera Games Catalog - Web portal for managing game catalogs
 A web portal catalog for Batocera gamelist.xml files, displaying game
 catalogs with Discord authentication and download queue management.
 .
 Features:
 - Discord OAuth2 authentication
 - Guild membership verification
 - Game catalog browsing by system
 - Search functionality across all systems
 - Download queue management
 - API token system for download service integration

